                <mxCell id="lim" value="No service worker / offline · no code-coverage gate in CI · no component-test layer · no Storybook / design-system doc · /api/me not cached&#xa;Open: component test bed (DataTable, MetricCard, Sidebar gating, RouteErrorBoundary) · coverage gate · Cloud Logging alert policy (5xx, p95) · component doc surface&#xa;• failure-notifier Logging sink filter is resource.type=cloud_run_job — solyra-api-prod SERVICE errors never auto-create GitHub issues.&#xa;• Secrets via --set-secrets: trading-db-pass · alphavantage / fred / benzinga / anthropic API keys." style="rounded=1;arcSize=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eef2fb;strokeColor=#6b83c9;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=9;fontColor=#1f2933;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=5;" parent="1" vertex="1">
