                <mxCell id="recon" value="Rebuild reconciliation note  (2026-06-23 icon rebuild)&#xa;──────────────────────────────&#xa;Docs pinned at the 2026-05-22 refresh; unchanged through HEAD 1c0523c (2026-06-21).&#xa;Numbers reconciled to the ARCHITECTURE.md / ERD.md doc body where the file disagreed with itself:&#xa;• 42 Cloud Run Jobs = deployed total (system-overview prose + GCP-resources table).&#xa;   &#39;27 Jobs&#39; is scoped to what gcp/deploy.sh creates in one pass (a subset) and is kept verbatim.&#xa;• ~50 Cloud Scheduler crons = verified total (Reconciliation §1); &#39;~49&#39; is the deploy.sh-visible count.&#xa;• 19 Secret Manager secrets = GCP-resources table (authoritative); the old legend &#39;21&#39; was stale.&#xa;• 44 CREATE TABLE total, ~33 user-facing (consistent across both docs).&#xa;Iconography: official GCP2 stencils (Cloud Run / SQL / Storage / Scheduler / Tasks / PubSub /&#xa;Logging / Container Registry / IAP / KMS). Non-Google systems use branded tiles, not fake GCP icons." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff6e0;strokeColor=#d6b656;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;size=18;fontColor=#1f2933;" parent="1" vertex="1">
